WEBVTT

00:06:29.382 --> 00:06:30.576
And he was saying,

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:34.615
"I'm no more responsible to take care
of this environment than a duck is."

00:06:35.887 --> 00:06:38.477
Well now, I know a lot
of times we act like ducks,

00:06:38.501 --> 00:06:39.699
but you're not a duck.

00:06:40.635 --> 00:06:41.805
You're not a duck.

00:06:42.543 --> 00:06:45.421
And you are responsible --
that's my worldview.

00:06:46.397 --> 00:06:50.672
And so, you need to understand
what your worldview is.

00:06:50.696 --> 00:06:54.196
The problem is most people
never really think it through.

00:06:54.783 --> 00:06:58.722
They never really ...

00:06:58.746 --> 00:07:02.079
codify it or qualify it or quantify it,